- Accessed the second ANYRUN sandbox analysis.
- ANYRUN classified the .xlsx attachment as: Malicious activity
- Identified the file name: CBJ200620039539.xlsx

Step 11 — Extract Excel attachment hashes
- Retrieved the SHA256 hash from the ANYRUN analysis:
```
5f94a66e0ce78d17afc2dd27fc17b44b3ffc13ac5f42d3ad6a5dcfb36715f3eb
```

Step 12 — Identify malicious IP and domains
- Reviewed the ANYRUN text report for network connections from EQNEDT32.EXE:
```
EQNEDT32.EXE -> GET -> 204.11.56.48:80 -> http://biz9holdings.com/INVOICE/COVID19.exe -> malicious
```
- IP associated with biz9holdings.com: 204.11.56.48
